## 11. Compliance — CISA 2026 Minimum Elements for a Software Bill of Materials

Informational; not part of the weighted scorecard. `warn` = covered only by a declared unknown (NOASSERTION); `unverified` = cannot be judged from the document alone. Gate on these in CI with `--require-min-elements` (skip IDs via `--skip-min-elements`).

| Element | ID | Scope | mikebom v0.1.0-alpha.47 | cyclonedx-gomod v1.9.0 |
|---------|----|-------|-----------------------|----------------------|
| SBOM Author | `author` | document | ✅ mikebom contributors | ❌ missing |
| Author Signature | `signature` | document | ❔ not signed in-document | ❔ not signed in-document |
| Data Format Name | `format-name` | document | ✅ SPDX | ✅ CycloneDX |
| Data Format Version | `format-version` | document | ✅ SPDX-3.0.1 | ✅ CycloneDX-1.5 |
| Generation Context | `generation-context` | document | ✅ source | ❌ not declared (inferred: source) |
| Timestamp | `timestamp` | document | ✅ 2026-06-16T16:02:16Z | ✅ 2026-06-16T16:12:00Z |
| Tool Name | `tool-name` | document | ✅ mikebom-0.1.0-alpha.47 | ✅ cyclonedx-gomod 1.9.0 |
| Tool Version | `tool-version` | document | ✅ mikebom-0.1.0-alpha.47 | ✅ cyclonedx-gomod 1.9.0 |
| SBOM Version | `sbom-version` | document | ✅ https://example.com/demo/source#document | ✅ urn:uuid:aaaaaaaa-bbbb-cccc-dddd-eeeeeeeeeeee#1 |
| Component Producer | `producer` | component | ✅ 4/4 (100.0%) | ❌ 1/2 (50.0%) |
| Component Name | `name` | component | ✅ 4/4 (100.0%) | ✅ 2/2 (100.0%) |
| Component Version | `version` | component | ✅ 4/4 (100.0%) | ✅ 2/2 (100.0%) |
| Software Identifiers | `identifiers` | component | ✅ 4/4 (100.0%) | ✅ 2/2 (100.0%) |
| Component Hash (value + algorithm) | `hash` | component | ❌ 3/4 (75.0%) | ❌ 1/2 (50.0%) |
